==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns as the boss after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[LeMurr]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*7 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns after 110 seconds<sup>3,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A decent anti-Alien CC unit can deal with the Nimoy Bores easily. If you have a relatively low power anti-Alien uber you can burn, you might consider using it here.

